@startuml fab-telemetry-dataflow
!include uml-palette.puml
title Fab Automation - Telemetry + QA Feedback Loop (ADR-FAB-003) - tag: telemetry

component "K1 Max internal camera" as CAM1 <<source>>
component "Zowiebox NDI-HX3\nRTSP bed-plate angle" as CAM2 <<source>>
component "Hubitat C8 sensors\ntemp / humidity / mmWave / motion" as SENS <<source>>
component "Z-Wave outlet monitor\nwatts, switching" as WATTS <<source>>

component "Obico (self-hosted)\nLayer 1: failure detection" as L1 <<special>>
component "Frame metrics\nLayer 2: bed-clear, first layer" as L2 <<core>>
component "Environment + power join\nLayer 3: C8 + Prometheus" as L3 <<ingest>>

database "Prometheus\nexisting house metrics store" as PROM <<store>>
database "Job record (git + sacct)\nframes, verdicts, kWh/part" as REC <<store>>

component "Defect taxonomy\none row per verdict" as TAX <<core>>
component "Profile diff\nqa/<job-id> branch" as DIFF <<derived>>
component "Jenkins build result\n= QA verdict" as JENK <<report>>
component "Hard kill (fire-class only)\noutlet power cut" as KILL <<alert>>

CAM1 --> L1
CAM2 --> L2
SENS --> L3
WATTS --> L3
L3 --> PROM : query series
L1 --> TAX
L2 --> TAX
L3 --> TAX : env correlation\n(profile fault vs cold room)
TAX --> REC
TAX --> DIFF : profile-class defects
DIFF ..> TAX : merged profile\nfeeds next print
TAX --> JENK : pass / fail
L1 --> KILL : failure + temp anomaly
KILL --> WATTS : cut

legend right
  |= Role |= Meaning |
  | <<source>> | cameras + sensors |
  | <<special>> | AI detection |
  | <<core>> | QA analysis |
  | <<ingest>> | telemetry join |
  | <<store>> | metrics + job records |
  | <<derived>> | profile diffs |
  | <<report>> | Jenkins result surface |
  | <<alert>> | fire-class hard kill |
endlegend
@enduml
